<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MGM Grand raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MGM Grand raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rodman &amp; Renshaw said on Friday it raised its rating on MGM Grand Inc to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Daniel Davila noted a target price of $50 for the stock, reflecting an increase above 35 percent and which he said could be achieved by mid-1997.</p>
<p>-- &quot;In general, the company appears on track in nearly every facet of its business,&quot; he wrote. &quot;Business trends are excellent and the company definitely is preparing for the future.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-1/4 to $38.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
